\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Platform architecture. Agent teams run inside the collaboration runtime through pluggable harness adapters; all plant-facing operations cross the governance block, which evaluates binding scope, the four-layer admission interval, approval records, and receipt grading, and writes every decision to the audit ledger. The industrial side separates acquisition from write control and persists telemetry in an embedded or provisioned time-series store.}}{14}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:arch}{{1}{14}{Platform architecture. Agent teams run inside the collaboration runtime through pluggable harness adapters; all plant-facing operations cross the governance block, which evaluates binding scope, the four-layer admission interval, approval records, and receipt grading, and writes every decision to the audit ledger. The industrial side separates acquisition from write control and persists telemetry in an embedded or provisioned time-series store}{figure.1}{}}
