\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces The governed write path. A machine-originated setpoint write crosses scope and policy checks, the four-layer admission interval, rate and step limits, a human approval record with tuple recheck, dispatch-time revalidation, driver execution, readback verification, and receipt grading; every stage's verdict, including rejections, lands in the audit ledger. Rejection paths are drawn dashed.}}{17}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:writepath}{{2}{17}{The governed write path. A machine-originated setpoint write crosses scope and policy checks, the four-layer admission interval, rate and step limits, a human approval record with tuple recheck, dispatch-time revalidation, driver execution, readback verification, and receipt grading; every stage's verdict, including rejections, lands in the audit ledger. Rejection paths are drawn dashed}{figure.2}{}}
